      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "Start is 1173 (Visit Tuscany: August 1173; Smithsonian: 1173); the Opera della Primaziale quotes Vasari for 1174. Sources opened disagree on completion (Italia.it: not completed until 1300), so the end is the present; the tower stands."
