  "reviewer_note": "Shape tower, round (sourced diameter). The model is drawn upright; the lean is not modelled. Completion year is unsourced on any page I could open (Italia.it says 1300; common accounts say 1372 but the ICE page was blocked), so the single phase is open-ended. Heights differ by source (58.36 m OPA/Italia.it; 56 m Visit Tuscany); OPA used.",
